{"slug": "C_S02E19", "video_name": "Community - S02E19 - Critical Film Studies Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E19 - Critical Film Studies Bluray-1080p Proper.en.srt", "duration_seconds": 1236.908, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "local", "stt_model": "ggml-small.en-q5_1.bin", "segment_count": 535, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.896235294117647, "text": "It was my friend Abed's birthday."}, {"start": 2.896235294117647, "end": 7.46, "text": "I had met Abed at community college almost two years"}, {"start": 7.46, "end": 7.918666666666667, "text": "earlier."}, {"start": 7.918666666666667, "end": 11.129333333333333, "text": "His obsession with pop culture had always alienated him."}, {"start": 11.129333333333333, "end": 12.62, "text": "He'd quote movies, pretend"}, {"start": 12.62, "end": 14.981190476190475, "text": "his life was a TV show, he'd watch Cougar Town."}, {"start": 14.981190476190475, "end": 16.84, "text": "It was as if he didn't want people to"}, {"start": 16.84, "end": 17.485, "text": "like him."}, {"start": 17.485, "end": 22.86, "text": "Then this year, around Christmas, he had some kind of, I don't know, mental"}, {"start": 22.86, "end": 26.41103448275862, "text": "episode saying people were made of clay, stuff like that."}, {"start": 26.41103448275862, "end": 28.28, "text": "He seemed okay since, but when"}, {"start": 28.28, "end": 30.133777777777777, "text": "I asked him if he'd like to do anything for"}, {"start": 30.133777777777777, "end": 32.16, "text": "his birthday, he told me we should have dinner."}, {"start": 32.16, "end": 35.33209302325581, "text": "Just he and I for an important conversation."}, {"start": 35.33209302325581, "end": 36.701860465116276, "text": "It made me nervous."}, {"start": 36.701860465116276, "end": 38.36, "text": "The restaurant Abed had"}, {"start": 38.36, "end": 40.28048780487805, "text": "chosen wasn't his style at all."}, {"start": 40.28048780487805, "end": 42.32487804878049, "text": "There were cloth napkins, no TVs."}, {"start": 42.32487804878049, "end": 43.44, "text": "Abed liked chicken"}, {"start": 43.44, "end": 46.42901098901099, "text": "fingers, video games, Quentin Tarantino."}, {"start": 46.42901098901099, "end": 50.24, "text": "Babysitting him through a full meal at a restaurant"}, {"start": 50.24, "end": 51.45333333333333, "text": "for grownups?"}, {"start": 51.45333333333333, "end": 53.69333333333333, "text": "I just wasn't up for it."}, {"start": 53.69333333333333, "end": 55.279999999999994, "text": "But I loved Abed."}, {"start": 55.279999999999994, "end": 56.493333333333325, "text": "Everyone did."}, {"start": 56.493333333333325, "end": 57.8, "text": "So he had come"}, {"start": 57.8, "end": 63.582325581395345, "text": "there with a surprise plan of my own."}, {"start": 63.582325581395345, "end": 69.05209302325581, "text": "Hey, uh, can I get a Macallan Neat?"}, {"start": 69.05209302325581, "end": 70.30232558139534, "text": "Jeffrey!"}, {"start": 70.30232558139534, "end": 71.24, "text": "Buddy?"}, {"start": 71.24, "end": 73.62139534883721, "text": "I like your sweater."}, {"start": 73.62139534883721, "end": 77.90790697674419, "text": "Did it come with a golden retriever?"}, {"start": 77.90790697674419, "end": 80.05116279069767, "text": "You look good too."}, {"start": 80.05116279069767, "end": 81.48, "text": "I would like"}, {"start": 81.48, "end": 82.98123456790124, "text": "a, uh, spritzer."}, {"start": 82.98123456790124, "end": 84.95160493827161, "text": "Abed was being weird."}, {"start": 84.95160493827161, "end": 88.89234567901235, "text": "And by that, I mean he wasn't being weird."}, {"start": 88.89234567901235, "end": 89.08, "text": "He"}, {"start": 89.08, "end": 91.42558139534884, "text": "was hugging, smiling, making eye contact."}, {"start": 91.42558139534884, "end": 94.0, "text": "And in 30 seconds, he hadn't made a reference"}, {"start": 94.0, "end": 94.80727272727273, "text": "to anything."}, {"start": 94.80727272727273, "end": 98.64181818181818, "text": "I had come in worried about him, thinking he needed help."}, {"start": 98.64181818181818, "end": 99.92, "text": "But seeing him like"}, {"start": 99.92, "end": 103.10987341772152, "text": "this made me more worried than ever."}, {"start": 103.10987341772152, "end": 103.73012658227847, "text": "Get it?"}, {"start": 103.73012658227847, "end": 105.32506329113923, "text": "Like Pulp Fiction."}, {"start": 105.32506329113923, "end": 106.92, "text": "It's a wallet that"}, {"start": 106.92, "end": 109.01720930232558, "text": "says bad mother- Thank you."}, {"start": 109.01720930232558, "end": 110.8813953488372, "text": "Actually, I had an idea."}, {"start": 110.8813953488372, "end": 113.6, "text": "I saw a very cool burger place just"}, {"start": 113.6, "end": 114.84930232558139, "text": "a few- Bad sense."}, {"start": 114.84930232558139, "end": 117.42139534883721, "text": "I didn't come downtown for burgers."}, {"start": 117.42139534883721, "end": 118.22976744186046, "text": "Come, come."}, {"start": 118.22976744186046, "end": 119.92, "text": "Uh, I'll, I'll be right"}, {"start": 119.92, "end": 120.50698795180723, "text": "there."}, {"start": 120.50698795180723, "end": 124.51807228915662, "text": "Hey, uh, we're running a little bit late."}, {"start": 124.51807228915662, "end": 125.69204819277108, "text": "No big deal."}, {"start": 125.69204819277108, "end": 128.04, "text": "Just a small speed bump."}, {"start": 131.31, "end": 133.2315189873418, "text": "Well, hurry up."}, {"start": 133.2315189873418, "end": 135.02493670886076, "text": "We're waiting."}, {"start": 135.02493670886076, "end": 136.17784810126582, "text": "Surprise!"}, {"start": 136.17784810126582, "end": 137.33075949367088, "text": "Guys, no!"}, {"start": 137.33075949367088, "end": 139.7646835443038, "text": "We're running late."}, {"start": 139.7646835443038, "end": 140.27708860759495, "text": "Aww."}, {"start": 140.27708860759495, "end": 141.43, "text": "Jeff says"}, {"start": 141.43, "end": 142.8439534883721, "text": "there's some kind of speed bump."}, {"start": 142.8439534883721, "end": 144.65558139534886, "text": "I was trying to figure it out a long ago."}, {"start": 144.65558139534886, "end": 145.23000000000002, "text": "Here's nobody"}, {"start": 145.23000000000002, "end": 146.38189873417724, "text": "can hear you."}, {"start": 146.38189873417724, "end": 147.62240506329115, "text": "Well, I'm hot."}, {"start": 147.62240506329115, "end": 150.36924050632913, "text": "My balls are touching a zipper."}, {"start": 150.36924050632913, "end": 150.72367088607598, "text": "Ugh."}, {"start": 150.72367088607598, "end": 152.23000000000002, "text": "Give me some more"}, {"start": 152.23000000000002, "end": 152.8472839506173, "text": "time."}, {"start": 152.8472839506173, "end": 153.7114814814815, "text": "A tree."}, {"start": 153.7114814814815, "end": 158.2793827160494, "text": "Give me the hope to run out of steam."}, {"start": 158.2793827160494, "end": 162.23000000000002, "text": "Somebody said you could be here."}, {"start": 162.23000000000002, "end": 163.22132530120484, "text": "Keep going."}, {"start": 163.22132530120484, "end": 165.74469879518074, "text": "Oh, the time I've been here."}, {"start": 165.74469879518074, "end": 169.34951807228916, "text": "I can't count the reasons I should stay."}, {"start": 169.34951807228916, "end": 169.70999999999998, "text": "Walk"}, {"start": 169.70999999999998, "end": 174.06325842696629, "text": "about one day I'll just stay."}, {"start": 174.06325842696629, "end": 179.1009274423919, "text": "Can you imagine the expression on"}, {"start": 179.1009274423919, "end": 183.07, "text": "Abbot's face when he walks"}, {"start": 183.07, "end": 183.2536144578313, "text": "in?"}, {"start": 183.2536144578313, "end": 184.90614457831322, "text": "Of course I can imagine it."}, {"start": 184.90614457831322, "end": 186.19144578313248, "text": "It's always the same."}, {"start": 186.19144578313248, "end": 188.14999999999998, "text": "Yeah, but he's gonna say cool at"}, {"start": 188.14999999999998, "end": 189.51, "text": "least five times."}, {"start": 189.51, "end": 193.27, "text": "It's really great of Jeff to put this together."}, {"start": 193.27, "end": 194.55, "text": "I'm not jealous."}, {"start": 194.55, "end": 194.87, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 194.87, "end": 195.54285714285714, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 195.54285714285714, "end": 198.98190476190476, "text": "Someone got him a briefcase like in the movie."}, {"start": 198.98190476190476, "end": 199.95380952380953, "text": "What's in it?"}, {"start": 199.95380952380953, "end": 201.14999999999998, "text": "Hey, don't touch"}, {"start": 201.14999999999998, "end": 201.61746987951804, "text": "that."}, {"start": 201.61746987951804, "end": 206.85313253012043, "text": "It's from Jeff and he says nobody but Abbot can open it."}, {"start": 206.85313253012043, "end": 207.22710843373488, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 207.22710843373488, "end": 208.44253012048188, "text": "What's in it?"}, {"start": 208.44253012048188, "end": 208.90999999999997, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 208.90999999999997, "end": 210.93186046511624, "text": "I have 3D vision now."}, {"start": 210.93186046511624, "end": 212.08720930232556, "text": "Yes, you do."}, {"start": 212.08720930232556, "end": 213.8202325581395, "text": "You don't know me."}, {"start": 213.8202325581395, "end": 217.19, "text": "Everybody just be patient and don't"}, {"start": 217.19, "end": 218.1875, "text": "mess with anything."}, {"start": 218.1875, "end": 221.2325, "text": "I am responsible for this diner when my boss isn't around."}, {"start": 221.2325, "end": 221.39, "text": "She"}, {"start": 221.39, "end": 223.454, "text": "will not stop bragging about that."}, {"start": 223.454, "end": 223.8789411764706, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 223.8789411764706, "end": 226.55, "text": "Has anyone seen this film we're referencing?"}, {"start": 226.55, "end": 228.06136363636367, "text": "Am I the hero or the love interest?"}, {"start": 228.06136363636367, "end": 228.5795454545455, "text": "Oh, fiction?"}, {"start": 228.5795454545455, "end": 229.91818181818186, "text": "Yeah, it's all on the airplane."}, {"start": 229.91818181818186, "end": 230.35000000000002, "text": "It's cute."}, {"start": 230.35000000000002, "end": 233.5757777777778, "text": "It's a 30 minute film about a group of"}, {"start": 233.5757777777778, "end": 237.99, "text": "friends who like cheeseburgers dancing in the Bible."}, {"start": 237.99, "end": 240.26855421686747, "text": "Just not better than me."}, {"start": 240.26855421686747, "end": 240.64831325301205, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 240.64831325301205, "end": 241.78759036144578, "text": "I said, hmm."}, {"start": 241.78759036144578, "end": 244.1610843373494, "text": "Boy, is this menu stuffy."}, {"start": 244.1610843373494, "end": 245.87, "text": "I don't know about"}, {"start": 245.87, "end": 248.44860465116278, "text": "you, but I'd rather have it nice."}, {"start": 248.44860465116278, "end": 252.2774418604651, "text": "I get the asamu to start, I think, and the squab."}, {"start": 252.2774418604651, "end": 252.58999999999997, "text": "Very"}, {"start": 252.58999999999997, "end": 253.01716049382713, "text": "good."}, {"start": 253.01716049382713, "end": 254.89666666666665, "text": "They don't have quail."}, {"start": 254.89666666666665, "end": 256.00728395061725, "text": "Good to know."}, {"start": 256.00728395061725, "end": 256.5198765432098, "text": "Salad."}, {"start": 256.5198765432098, "end": 257.9722222222222, "text": "Excellent choice."}, {"start": 257.9722222222222, "end": 259.51, "text": "Yeah, I nailed it."}, {"start": 259.51, "end": 261.73749999999995, "text": "You forgot this on the bar."}, {"start": 261.73749999999995, "end": 262.80999999999995, "text": "Ah, so I did."}, {"start": 262.80999999999995, "end": 263.63499999999993, "text": "I'm sorry."}, {"start": 263.63499999999993, "end": 266.0274999999999, "text": "What a thoughtful gift, Jeff."}, {"start": 266.0274999999999, "end": 266.10999999999996, "text": "I"}, {"start": 266.10999999999996, "end": 267.94209876543204, "text": "really was a man of singular taste."}, {"start": 267.94209876543204, "end": 268.1514814814814, "text": "Was?"}, {"start": 268.1514814814814, "end": 269.3554320987654, "text": "Abbot, what's going on?"}, {"start": 269.3554320987654, "end": 270.34999999999997, "text": "Why are you dressed"}, {"start": 270.34999999999997, "end": 270.78534883720926, "text": "like Mr."}, {"start": 270.78534883720926, "end": 272.52674418604647, "text": "Rogers and talking like Frazier?"}, {"start": 272.52674418604647, "end": 273.66953488372087, "text": "What happened to you?"}, {"start": 273.66953488372087, "end": 274.48581395348833, "text": "Where to begin?"}, {"start": 274.48581395348833, "end": 275.03, "text": "I probably"}, {"start": 275.03, "end": 279.0181818181818, "text": "mentioned the past my fondness for a TV program called Cougar Town here and there."}, {"start": 279.0181818181818, "end": 279.31, "text": "I even"}, {"start": 279.31, "end": 281.3413636363636, "text": "started Cougar Town fan club on Facebook."}, {"start": 281.3413636363636, "end": 283.66999999999996, "text": "And not to accomplish anything, mind you simply"}, {"start": 283.66999999999996, "end": 285.4651219512195, "text": "to express my love for the show."}, {"start": 285.4651219512195, "end": 288.27, "text": "Well, it ended up being quite large this fan club."}, {"start": 288.27, "end": 290.7791764705882, "text": "And one morning, I think it was maybe early"}, {"start": 290.7791764705882, "end": 293.22999999999996, "text": "March, I got this Facebook message, a very"}, {"start": 293.22999999999996, "end": 297.50595505617974, "text": "nice message from the people who make Cougar Town looking for work."}, {"start": 297.50595505617974, "end": 298.90999999999997, "text": "Now thanking me, Jeff,"}, {"start": 298.90999999999997, "end": 300.91987654320985, "text": "you know, for all the support I generated for the show."}, {"start": 300.91987654320985, "end": 301.87, "text": "And in the last paragraph,"}, {"start": 301.87, "end": 305.96882352941174, "text": "they said if you'd like, you could come visit set just like that."}, {"start": 305.96882352941174, "end": 307.22999999999996, "text": "Well, that's cool of"}, {"start": 307.22999999999996, "end": 307.58662650602406, "text": "them."}, {"start": 307.58662650602406, "end": 311.86614457831325, "text": "I guess that kind of makes them the pulp fictions of people."}, {"start": 311.86614457831325, "end": 313.15, "text": "Man, how great was"}, {"start": 313.15, "end": 313.57188235294115, "text": "that movie?"}, {"start": 313.57188235294115, "end": 313.7636470588235, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 313.7636470588235, "end": 316.40999999999997, "text": "So I sold a few of my action figures and I bought a round trip ticket"}, {"start": 316.40999999999997, "end": 317.2112658227848, "text": "to Los Angeles."}, {"start": 317.2112658227848, "end": 317.79886075949366, "text": "Wait, what?"}, {"start": 317.79886075949366, "end": 318.2796202531646, "text": "You went?"}, {"start": 318.2796202531646, "end": 318.5467088607595, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 318.5467088607595, "end": 318.81379746835444, "text": "When?"}, {"start": 318.81379746835444, "end": 319.7753164556962, "text": "Over spring break."}, {"start": 319.7753164556962, "end": 320.63, "text": "What could I do?"}, {"start": 320.63, "end": 324.2918181818182, "text": "Two days after I got that invitation, I was on the set of Cougar Town, Jeff."}, {"start": 324.2918181818182, "end": 324.87, "text": "Cougar Town."}, {"start": 324.87, "end": 328.83190476190475, "text": "Look, if you want me to take it seriously, stop saying its name."}, {"start": 328.83190476190475, "end": 330.07, "text": "You laugh, Jeff, but"}, {"start": 330.07, "end": 331.2216049382716, "text": "people were wonderful."}, {"start": 331.2216049382716, "end": 334.04827160493824, "text": "You know, not just the actors, but the crew, everyone."}, {"start": 334.04827160493824, "end": 334.31, "text": "There"}, {"start": 334.31, "end": 336.8351063829787, "text": "must have been 200 people each with a specific"}, {"start": 336.8351063829787, "end": 339.46999999999997, "text": "function, but all dedicated to a single purpose."}, {"start": 339.46999999999997, "end": 341.7251724137931, "text": "It was like a village or like a living thing."}, {"start": 341.7251724137931, "end": 343.83, "text": "And, you know, I'm talking to the director"}, {"start": 343.83, "end": 346.44268292682926, "text": "and he says, why don't you jump into the background?"}, {"start": 346.44268292682926, "end": 347.95, "text": "I say, no, wait a minute, jump"}, {"start": 347.95, "end": 349.1411111111111, "text": "into the background of what exactly?"}, {"start": 349.1411111111111, "end": 350.63, "text": "And he says, jump into the background of this"}, {"start": 350.63, "end": 355.2966666666667, "text": "scene, walk through it, walk through Cougar Town."}, {"start": 355.2966666666667, "end": 358.63, "text": "Well, before I can react, this girl"}, {"start": 358.63, "end": 360.15, "text": "takes me by the hand and she stands me"}, {"start": 360.15, "end": 362.19, "text": "behind this patio where Courtney Cox and the actors"}, {"start": 362.19, "end": 363.04929411764704, "text": "are doing their scene."}, {"start": 363.04929411764704, "end": 365.51, "text": "And the girl says, now when you hear action, I want you to walk"}, {"start": 365.51, "end": 367.02162790697673, "text": "from here to there, right?"}, {"start": 367.02162790697673, "end": 370.51, "text": "That's why I really started to panic, Jeff, because if I'm a"}, {"start": 370.51, "end": 374.0671084337349, "text": "person that watches Cougar Town, how can I be in Cougar Town?"}, {"start": 374.0671084337349, "end": 375.34999999999997, "text": "You know, and the more"}, {"start": 375.34999999999997, "end": 378.8328571428571, "text": "I start thinking about it, the less any of it makes any sense at all."}, {"start": 378.8328571428571, "end": 379.59, "text": "And I just want"}, {"start": 379.59, "end": 383.00853658536585, "text": "to turn and run, but it's too late because the director's calling action."}, {"start": 383.00853658536585, "end": 383.43, "text": "So before"}, {"start": 383.43, "end": 385.45070588235296, "text": "I take my first step, I realize that I"}, {"start": 385.45070588235296, "end": 387.95, "text": "have to stop being someone who's ever seen this"}, {"start": 387.95, "end": 393.53318181818184, "text": "show and become a character on the show, become a man from Cougar Town."}, {"start": 393.53318181818184, "end": 394.87, "text": "You know, someone"}, {"start": 394.87, "end": 397.76156626506025, "text": "born there, someone whose name I decide is Chad."}, {"start": 397.76156626506025, "end": 399.87, "text": "And I take my first step as a child"}, {"start": 399.87, "end": 401.3973170731707, "text": "might learning to walk as Chad."}, {"start": 401.3973170731707, "end": 403.26951219512193, "text": "And with each step, it becomes easier."}, {"start": 403.26951219512193, "end": 403.90999999999997, "text": "And with each"}, {"start": 403.90999999999997, "end": 406.6827272727272, "text": "step, I start remembering things from Chad's life,"}, {"start": 406.6827272727272, "end": 408.78999999999996, "text": "like his first kiss under the big tree"}, {"start": 408.78999999999996, "end": 411.6355813953488, "text": "at Cougar Town field, playing soccer at Cougar"}, {"start": 411.6355813953488, "end": 414.10999999999996, "text": "Town Junior High, finding my first chest"}, {"start": 414.10999999999996, "end": 416.7782352941176, "text": "hair in the shower, my first apartment, my"}, {"start": 416.7782352941176, "end": 419.51, "text": "first true love falling for my best friend,"}, {"start": 419.51, "end": 423.7823688606749, "text": "birthdays, weddings, car crashes, taxes,"}, {"start": 423.7823688606749, "end": 427.3070731707317, "text": "playing charades at Thanksgiving."}, {"start": 427.3070731707317, "end": 428.15, "text": "Chad had"}, {"start": 428.15, "end": 429.27376470588234, "text": "lived, Jeff."}, {"start": 429.27376470588234, "end": 432.17682352941176, "text": "Chad had lived more than op-ed."}, {"start": 432.17682352941176, "end": 434.518, "text": "And then they called cut."}, {"start": 434.518, "end": 436.10999999999996, "text": "And the scene was"}, {"start": 439.892, "end": 440.2061176470588, "text": "over."}, {"start": 440.2061176470588, "end": 442.5934117647059, "text": "But I wasn't ready to stop being Chad."}, {"start": 442.5934117647059, "end": 445.232, "text": "So I said to the director, can we have one"}, {"start": 445.232, "end": 446.1177142857143, "text": "more take?"}, {"start": 446.1177142857143, "end": 448.95200000000006, "text": "But they were already moving on."}, {"start": 448.95200000000006, "end": 450.9891428571429, "text": "Courtney had nailed it."}, {"start": 450.9891428571429, "end": 453.29200000000003, "text": "My lips started trembling."}, {"start": 456.09200000000004, "end": 458.2915238095238, "text": "My hands and my feet went numb."}, {"start": 458.2915238095238, "end": 459.4977142857143, "text": "My knees buckled."}, {"start": 459.4977142857143, "end": 462.052, "text": "And as I fell to the floor, I pooped"}, {"start": 464.933, "end": 465.7440843373494, "text": "my pants."}, {"start": 465.7440843373494, "end": 466.28480722891567, "text": "I did."}, {"start": 466.28480722891567, "end": 471.87227710843376, "text": "Because the truth is, Jeff, I had been Chad and Chad was dead."}, {"start": 471.87227710843376, "end": 472.413, "text": "But as"}, {"start": 474.964, "end": 476.41638095238096, "text": "op-ed, I was still alive."}, {"start": 476.41638095238096, "end": 477.8106666666667, "text": "So someone helped me up."}, {"start": 477.8106666666667, "end": 479.6697142857143, "text": "And the wardrobe lady came over."}, {"start": 479.6697142857143, "end": 479.844, "text": "She"}, {"start": 479.844, "end": 480.825, "text": "gave me new pants."}, {"start": 480.825, "end": 481.8605, "text": "I thanked everyone."}, {"start": 481.8605, "end": 482.569, "text": "I apologized."}, {"start": 482.569, "end": 484.204, "text": "And then I just got out of bus"}, {"start": 484.204, "end": 488.762125, "text": "and went straight"}, {"start": 488.762125, "end": 492.784, "text": "to the airport."}, {"start": 492.784, "end": 499.284, "text": "Your food's getting cold."}, {"start": 499.284, "end": 505.524, "text": "Well, I'll still eat me."}, {"start": 505.524, "end": 506.56399999999996, "text": "Hmm."}, {"start": 509.354, "end": 514.402275862069, "text": "Hearing of op-ed's new best friend also gotten the best gift."}, {"start": 514.402275862069, "end": 516.5540000000001, "text": "I got op-ed the best gift."}, {"start": 516.5540000000001, "end": 521.3200869565218, "text": "I tell you what it is, but it's an even cooler secret."}, {"start": 521.3200869565218, "end": 524.674, "text": "Britta, you promised that this private"}, {"start": 524.674, "end": 525.9869670329671, "text": "party would be done by eight."}, {"start": 525.9869670329671, "end": 528.7940000000001, "text": "You're doing this during the peak business hours for nostalgic"}, {"start": 528.7940000000001, "end": 529.4940000000001, "text": "themed diners."}, {"start": 529.4940000000001, "end": 530.3440000000002, "text": "Oh, is that true?"}, {"start": 530.3440000000002, "end": 531.5940000000002, "text": "Has that been researched?"}, {"start": 531.5940000000002, "end": 532.2940000000002, "text": "It has, Annie."}, {"start": 532.2940000000002, "end": 532.7940000000001, "text": "After they"}, {"start": 532.7940000000001, "end": 534.2416190476191, "text": "get frightened by the evening news, many"}, {"start": 534.2416190476191, "end": 535.8340000000001, "text": "seek the comforting foods and soothing music"}, {"start": 535.8340000000001, "end": 537.1021481481482, "text": "of a pre-racial America."}, {"start": 537.1021481481482, "end": 538.0004197530865, "text": "I'm sorry, Brian."}, {"start": 538.0004197530865, "end": 539.4270864197531, "text": "They're just a little late."}, {"start": 539.4270864197531, "end": 540.114, "text": "I'll give you"}, {"start": 540.114, "end": 543.4925714285714, "text": "all of my tips for my next shift."}, {"start": 543.4925714285714, "end": 544.9259047619047, "text": "Oh, your tips."}, {"start": 544.9259047619047, "end": 546.359238095238, "text": "All your tips?"}, {"start": 546.359238095238, "end": 547.4854285714284, "text": "Wait, wait."}, {"start": 547.4854285714284, "end": 548.7139999999999, "text": "All of them?"}, {"start": 548.7139999999999, "end": 551.653512195122, "text": "Like all the tips the customers leave for you?"}, {"start": 551.653512195122, "end": 551.9091219512195, "text": "Wow."}, {"start": 551.9091219512195, "end": 553.954, "text": "Is there any way we can go ahead"}, {"start": 553.954, "end": 560.4330697674418, "text": "and spread that out over two years so I don't get slammed on my taxes?"}, {"start": 560.4330697674418, "end": 561.914, "text": "Oh, my goodness."}, {"start": 561.914, "end": 563.3949756097561, "text": "It's Britta."}, {"start": 563.3949756097561, "end": 563.8886341463415, "text": "Hmm."}, {"start": 563.8886341463415, "end": 564.3822926829268, "text": "Hmm."}, {"start": 564.3822926829268, "end": 571.0466829268294, "text": "Well, of course you know the real point of that story."}, {"start": 571.0466829268294, "end": 572.0340000000001, "text": "I don't,"}, {"start": 572.0340000000001, "end": 573.1159047619049, "text": "but that's okay."}, {"start": 573.1159047619049, "end": 573.4540000000001, "text": "Chew."}, {"start": 573.4540000000001, "end": 575.4825714285714, "text": "The point is, I'd been a fool."}, {"start": 575.4825714285714, "end": 577.7139999999999, "text": "Nah, everybody poops their pants."}, {"start": 577.7139999999999, "end": 578.1028372093023, "text": "No, no, no."}, {"start": 578.1028372093023, "end": 579.1633023255813, "text": "I was a fool long before that."}, {"start": 579.1633023255813, "end": 580.7539999999999, "text": "You know, I look back at my life and I think,"}, {"start": 580.7539999999999, "end": 581.2739999999999, "text": "who was that?"}, {"start": 581.2739999999999, "end": 583.874, "text": "Why did you care so much about so many things that didn't matter?"}, {"start": 583.874, "end": 584.0740000000001, "text": "Yeah,"}, {"start": 584.0740000000001, "end": 584.9646024096386, "text": "who needs Cougar Town?"}, {"start": 584.9646024096386, "end": 586.4624337349397, "text": "Who needs any pop culture whatsoever?"}, {"start": 586.4624337349397, "end": 587.434, "text": "TV, movies, to hell with"}, {"start": 587.434, "end": 588.0833827160493, "text": "all of it."}, {"start": 588.0833827160493, "end": 589.7717777777777, "text": "You know what I was, Jeff?"}, {"start": 589.7717777777777, "end": 590.9406666666666, "text": "I was that wallet."}, {"start": 590.9406666666666, "end": 592.694, "text": "On the surface, a reference"}, {"start": 592.694, "end": 596.9213333333333, "text": "to some cinematic drivel, but on the inside, empty."}, {"start": 596.9213333333333, "end": 598.8277777777778, "text": "But you love Tarantino?"}, {"start": 598.8277777777778, "end": 600.154, "text": "No, not anymore."}, {"start": 600.154, "end": 602.229294117647, "text": "That's why I wanted to have this dinner with you."}, {"start": 602.229294117647, "end": 603.7539999999999, "text": "This is the first birthday of my new"}, {"start": 603.7539999999999, "end": 603.9234117647057, "text": "life."}, {"start": 603.9234117647057, "end": 606.634, "text": "You know, on the wall, it's cute, Jeff, but I'd like to exchange it for a better"}, {"start": 606.634, "end": 607.127670886076, "text": "gift."}, {"start": 607.127670886076, "end": 614.0390632911392, "text": "I'm not leaving here until you've given me my first real conversation."}, {"start": 614.0390632911392, "end": 614.434, "text": "Yay."}, {"start": 617.434, "end": 618.48, "text": "[MUSIC PLAYING]"}, {"start": 618.48, "end": 621.8538461538461, "text": "Okay, you want to have a real conversation?"}, {"start": 621.8538461538461, "end": 625.62, "text": "Here's as real as I get under the circumstances."}, {"start": 625.62, "end": 627.7764705882353, "text": "It's nice that you've learned to dial back your"}, {"start": 627.7764705882353, "end": 629.52, "text": "love of TV, but I'd really like you to"}, {"start": 629.52, "end": 630.9760975609756, "text": "come have a milkshake with me."}, {"start": 630.9760975609756, "end": 633.5, "text": "But before you do, I'd like you to remember how much"}, {"start": 633.5, "end": 634.9975555555556, "text": "you enjoy pulp fiction."}, {"start": 634.9975555555556, "end": 639.36, "text": "Now, it's as far as I can go without defeating the purpose, really."}, {"start": 639.36, "end": 640.6, "text": "Tilt on the bean can here."}, {"start": 640.6, "end": 641.2873563218391, "text": "Pulp fiction?"}, {"start": 641.2873563218391, "end": 641.8689655172413, "text": "Milkshakes?"}, {"start": 641.8689655172413, "end": 642.3977011494253, "text": "Bean cans?"}, {"start": 642.3977011494253, "end": 644.3011494252873, "text": "Listen to how we talk to each other."}, {"start": 644.3011494252873, "end": 645.2, "text": "We're like robots"}, {"start": 645.2, "end": 646.88, "text": "exchanging catchphrases and references."}, {"start": 646.88, "end": 649.8133333333333, "text": "You think pointing that out counts as a real conversation?"}, {"start": 649.8133333333333, "end": 651.28, "text": "You know how many fake people"}, {"start": 651.28, "end": 653.28, "text": "are talking about how fake the world is right now?"}, {"start": 653.28, "end": 656.24, "text": "Okay, well I'm new at this, so can you start our real conversation?"}, {"start": 656.24, "end": 658.3152173913044, "text": "I don't believe there's such a thing."}, {"start": 658.3152173913044, "end": 661.4, "text": "Conversation was invented by humans to conceal reality."}, {"start": 661.4, "end": 664.4945054945055, "text": "We use it to sweet talk a way around natural selection."}, {"start": 664.4945054945055, "end": 666.52, "text": "You know who has real conversations?"}, {"start": 666.52, "end": 666.7866666666666, "text": "Ants."}, {"start": 666.7866666666666, "end": 669.8266666666667, "text": "They talk by vomiting chemicals into each other's mouths."}, {"start": 669.8266666666667, "end": 670.84, "text": "They get right down"}, {"start": 670.84, "end": 672.1539240506329, "text": "to brass tacks."}, {"start": 672.1539240506329, "end": 674.2562025316455, "text": "Which weighs the picnic?"}, {"start": 674.2562025316455, "end": 675.0445569620252, "text": "That way."}, {"start": 675.0445569620252, "end": 677.1468354430378, "text": "Humans are more evolved."}, {"start": 677.1468354430378, "end": 677.76, "text": "We lie."}, {"start": 677.76, "end": 678.76, "text": "Not all the time."}, {"start": 678.76, "end": 679.76, "text": "That's a lie."}, {"start": 679.76, "end": 680.76, "text": "We don't lie when we're alone."}, {"start": 680.76, "end": 681.636, "text": "Biggest lie ever."}, {"start": 681.636, "end": 685.14, "text": "Nine out of ten lies occur six inches away from the bathroom mirror."}, {"start": 685.14, "end": 686.6800000000001, "text": "We do most of our lying alone."}, {"start": 686.6800000000001, "end": 688.36, "text": "How's it even possible to lie when you're alone?"}, {"start": 688.36, "end": 689.9963636363636, "text": "You can call a phone sex line."}, {"start": 689.9963636363636, "end": 691.36, "text": "That's lying to yourself."}, {"start": 691.36, "end": 693.82, "text": "No, that's just being honest with a stranger about being lonely."}, {"start": 693.82, "end": 695.5529268292684, "text": "What if you're dishonest about why you're lonely?"}, {"start": 695.5529268292684, "end": 696.72, "text": "What if you're a good looking guy"}, {"start": 696.72, "end": 701.52, "text": "who calls a phone sex line and tells them he weighs 400 pounds just so he can hear a"}, {"start": 701.52, "end": 703.4, "text": "woman say she's attracted to him anyway?"}, {"start": 703.4, "end": 704.88, "text": "I don't believe that happens."}, {"start": 704.88, "end": 705.3664864864865, "text": "Wrong."}, {"start": 705.3664864864865, "end": 706.1772972972973, "text": "That's me."}, {"start": 706.1772972972973, "end": 707.88, "text": "I did that last week."}, {"start": 707.88, "end": 708.120625, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 708.120625, "end": 710.96, "text": "Why would you pay a woman on the phone to think you're fat?"}, {"start": 710.96, "end": 716.6800000000001, "text": "Because I'm scared that if I were overweight that no one would like me."}, {"start": 716.6800000000001, "end": 718.4, "text": "God that feels good to admit."}, {"start": 718.4, "end": 723.0631325301205, "text": "I'll bet the point being, the point being"}, {"start": 723.0631325301205, "end": 727.84, "text": "you don't have to worry about being normal"}, {"start": 727.84, "end": 731.1600000000001, "text": "or real or whatever this is tonight."}, {"start": 731.1600000000001, "end": 736.88, "text": "The world is a sick place full of sick, sick people."}, {"start": 736.88, "end": 740.76, "text": "Can I tell you something I've never told anyone else?"}, {"start": 743.536, "end": 744.536, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 744.536, "end": 748.1257435897435, "text": "It's gotta be so cruel, whatever he got."}, {"start": 748.1257435897435, "end": 750.3693333333332, "text": "You know what I'm saying?"}, {"start": 750.3693333333332, "end": 751.536, "text": "He's a man of"}, {"start": 751.536, "end": 752.0454736842105, "text": "means."}, {"start": 752.0454736842105, "end": 756.376, "text": "He's with your boy right now having a fancy dinner."}, {"start": 756.376, "end": 761.096, "text": "Baby chickens, diamond borgs, brand name sodas."}, {"start": 761.096, "end": 766.896, "text": "Then he's gonna bring him back here, give him whatever's in there and that's that."}, {"start": 766.896, "end": 772.0261185770751, "text": "You know"}, {"start": 772.0261185770751, "end": 773.9499130434782, "text": "why"}, {"start": 773.9499130434782, "end": 780.4159999999999, "text": "he'll move?"}, {"start": 780.4159999999999, "end": 782.096, "text": "Is that what I think it is?"}, {"start": 782.096, "end": 782.6893333333334, "text": "It is."}, {"start": 782.6893333333334, "end": 785.656, "text": "A certificate of authenticity."}, {"start": 785.656, "end": 788.056, "text": "Must've got it on eBay or something."}, {"start": 788.056, "end": 792.096, "text": "Jeff got Abba the actual briefcase from the movie \"Pulp Fiction\"."}, {"start": 792.096, "end": 793.896, "text": "What are you guys doing?"}, {"start": 793.896, "end": 795.011625, "text": "Tang made me open it."}, {"start": 795.011625, "end": 797.2959999999999, "text": "He seduced me with his dark Chinese powers."}, {"start": 797.2959999999999, "end": 798.776, "text": "Why do you leave him alone with me?"}, {"start": 798.776, "end": 800.6998095238096, "text": "I am putting my job on the line for this"}, {"start": 800.6998095238096, "end": 802.816, "text": "stupid party and the least you can do is not"}, {"start": 802.816, "end": 804.136, "text": "ruin it."}, {"start": 804.136, "end": 806.616, "text": "No, no!"}, {"start": 806.616, "end": 812.7404444444444, "text": "Dude, I know I'm preaching"}, {"start": 812.7404444444444, "end": 817.4515555555555, "text": "to the choir but you"}, {"start": 817.4515555555555, "end": 821.4559999999999, "text": "are a bad friend."}, {"start": 821.4559999999999, "end": 825.0421538461537, "text": "I'll"}, {"start": 825.0421538461537, "end": 828.6283076923077, "text": "kill"}, {"start": 828.6283076923077, "end": 831.816, "text": "you!"}, {"start": 831.816, "end": 838.6959999999999, "text": "And I said, no, that's a girl's costume and my mom said, it's fine, Indian boys have"}, {"start": 838.6959999999999, "end": 840.096, "text": "long hair and braids too."}, {"start": 840.096, "end": 845.6959999999999, "text": "There was only 45 minutes left to trick or treat so what could I do?"}, {"start": 845.6959999999999, "end": 848.1955454545454, "text": "I put the damn thing on and I went door"}, {"start": 848.1955454545454, "end": 851.336, "text": "to door and everyone was going, oh, what a pretty"}, {"start": 851.336, "end": 857.736, "text": "little girl and by the third house, I stopped correcting them."}, {"start": 857.736, "end": 863.9632727272726, "text": "I mean why draw attention to it and honestly, once"}, {"start": 863.9632727272726, "end": 868.6959999999999, "text": "the shame and the fear wore off, I was"}, {"start": 868.6959999999999, "end": 870.896, "text": "just glad they thought I was pretty."}, {"start": 874.024, "end": 876.944, "text": "God, this is incredible."}, {"start": 876.944, "end": 883.184, "text": "I mean, to be able to talk this openly, I mean, why can't people be like this?"}, {"start": 883.184, "end": 888.4506666666666, "text": "I mean, what's wrong"}, {"start": 888.4506666666666, "end": 892.664, "text": "with this world?"}, {"start": 892.664, "end": 893.664, "text": "What do you want?"}, {"start": 893.664, "end": 895.624, "text": "So this is what you're doing while we wait."}, {"start": 895.624, "end": 898.4639999999999, "text": "Just go home, Pierce, party's canceled."}, {"start": 898.4639999999999, "end": 904.104, "text": "Pretty gay man, pretty gay."}, {"start": 904.104, "end": 906.384, "text": "Why is Pierce dressed as the gimp from Pulp Fiction?"}, {"start": 906.384, "end": 909.624, "text": "Ah, the wallet, looks shakest."}, {"start": 909.624, "end": 912.5440000000001, "text": "Did you set up a surprise Pulp Fiction birthday party?"}, {"start": 912.5440000000001, "end": 915.384, "text": "Yeah, the greasy fork but that doesn't matter now."}, {"start": 915.384, "end": 918.184, "text": "What matters is this, talking."}, {"start": 918.184, "end": 919.904, "text": "Is everything okay?"}, {"start": 919.904, "end": 921.984, "text": "Yes, just a check please."}, {"start": 921.984, "end": 924.5982857142858, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry, so you're ending early because"}, {"start": 924.5982857142858, "end": 926.864, "text": "in my dinner with Andre, the way you're"}, {"start": 926.864, "end": 927.864, "text": "doing it, goodbye."}, {"start": 927.864, "end": 929.184, "text": "I'll bet."}, {"start": 933.7470000000001, "end": 934.7470000000001, "text": "Mm-hmm."}, {"start": 934.7470000000001, "end": 936.947, "text": "What's my dinner with Andre?"}, {"start": 936.947, "end": 940.7077142857144, "text": "It's just a movie about two"}, {"start": 940.7077142857144, "end": 944.7470000000001, "text": "guys talking out of restroom."}, {"start": 944.7470000000001, "end": 948.867, "text": "So this wasn't a real conversation."}, {"start": 948.867, "end": 949.867, "text": "You were doing another movie?"}, {"start": 949.867, "end": 951.787, "text": "A movie about a real conversation."}, {"start": 951.787, "end": 954.9870000000001, "text": "Did you poop your pants on the set of Kookertown?"}, {"start": 954.9870000000001, "end": 955.9870000000001, "text": "That shouldn't matter."}, {"start": 955.9870000000001, "end": 958.627, "text": "This is why we don't hang out."}, {"start": 958.627, "end": 961.427, "text": "Well, thanks for getting me fired, jerks."}, {"start": 961.427, "end": 962.427, "text": "The party's over."}, {"start": 962.427, "end": 963.427, "text": "Cool, cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 963.427, "end": 964.427, "text": "Yeah, it is."}, {"start": 964.427, "end": 968.9870000000001, "text": "Do you guys know where Abed's really cool present is?"}, {"start": 968.9870000000001, "end": 970.307, "text": "Because I'm returning it."}, {"start": 970.307, "end": 972.307, "text": "Um, it's back at the diner."}, {"start": 972.307, "end": 973.307, "text": "It's fine."}, {"start": 973.307, "end": 975.947, "text": "It's in detailing."}, {"start": 975.947, "end": 981.667, "text": "Man, I really wish you two got along better."}, {"start": 981.667, "end": 984.587, "text": "Well, no, no juice."}, {"start": 984.587, "end": 987.827, "text": "Oh, that's good."}, {"start": 987.827, "end": 991.947, "text": "No, no juice."}, {"start": 991.947, "end": 996.1469999999999, "text": "I'll give you $1,200 for the damages if you promise to give Britta her job back."}, {"start": 996.1469999999999, "end": 998.787, "text": "It's $800 and she stays fired."}, {"start": 998.787, "end": 999.787, "text": "Deal."}, {"start": 999.787, "end": 1004.227, "text": "Andy told me"}, {"start": 1004.227, "end": 1007.7322631578947, "text": "about the"}, {"start": 1007.7322631578947, "end": 1011.627, "text": "briefcase."}, {"start": 1011.627, "end": 1012.627, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 1012.627, "end": 1013.627, "text": "What a waste."}, {"start": 1013.627, "end": 1014.627, "text": "Not really."}, {"start": 1014.627, "end": 1019.347, "text": "Did you buy it from Willie's 100% authentic cinema treasures on eBay?"}, {"start": 1019.347, "end": 1020.347, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 1020.347, "end": 1021.347, "text": "Yeah, Willie exaggerates."}, {"start": 1021.347, "end": 1023.867, "text": "I got Indiana Jones's real whip from him."}, {"start": 1023.867, "end": 1025.747, "text": "He moves about 70 of those a year."}, {"start": 1025.747, "end": 1026.747, "text": "Oh, good."}, {"start": 1026.747, "end": 1028.9470000000001, "text": "I thought I flushed a bunch of money down the toilet, but it's great to know that"}, {"start": 1028.9470000000001, "end": 1031.4270000000001, "text": "the real Pulp Fiction briefcase is safe somewhere."}, {"start": 1031.4270000000001, "end": 1033.467, "text": "You're mad at me."}, {"start": 1033.467, "end": 1035.667, "text": "I spent a week planning a party just to make"}, {"start": 1035.667, "end": 1037.867, "text": "you happy and then I bailed on the party and"}, {"start": 1037.867, "end": 1038.867, "text": "ruined it."}, {"start": 1038.867, "end": 1039.867, "text": "Again, just to make you happy."}, {"start": 1039.867, "end": 1041.6158372093023, "text": "Then it turns out while I was wasting my"}, {"start": 1041.6158372093023, "end": 1043.627, "text": "time trying to make you happy, you were making"}, {"start": 1043.627, "end": 1049.9470000000001, "text": "yourself happy all over everyone else by doing yet another stupid movie spoof."}, {"start": 1049.9470000000001, "end": 1055.107, "text": "But for the term homage, it wasn't about making me happy."}, {"start": 1055.107, "end": 1057.0235116279068, "text": "I chose my dinner with Andre because it's"}, {"start": 1057.0235116279068, "end": 1059.127, "text": "about a guy who has an unexpectedly enjoyable"}, {"start": 1059.127, "end": 1063.867, "text": "evening with a weird friend he's been avoiding lately."}, {"start": 1063.867, "end": 1066.307, "text": "You think I've been avoiding you?"}, {"start": 1066.307, "end": 1067.827, "text": "You and I hung out more last year."}, {"start": 1067.827, "end": 1070.547, "text": "It makes sense."}, {"start": 1070.547, "end": 1073.547, "text": "Everyone else is growing and changing all the time and that's not really my jam."}, {"start": 1073.547, "end": 1078.747, "text": "I'm more of a fast blinking stoic, removed, uncomfortably self-aware type."}, {"start": 1078.747, "end": 1082.167, "text": "Like Data, or Johnny Five, or Mark, or Hal,"}, {"start": 1082.167, "end": 1085.587, "text": "or Kit, or K9, or Woodstock, and/or Snoopy."}, {"start": 1085.587, "end": 1087.627, "text": "Of course Spock probably goes without saying."}, {"start": 1087.627, "end": 1090.2914705882354, "text": "I don't need you to grow or change and"}, {"start": 1090.2914705882354, "end": 1093.587, "text": "take it from someone who just had a meaningless"}, {"start": 1093.587, "end": 1094.587, "text": "one."}, {"start": 1094.587, "end": 1098.9270000000001, "text": "Sometimes emotional breakthroughs are overrated and seriously,"}, {"start": 1098.9270000000001, "end": 1100.747, "text": "I need you to keep a tight"}, {"start": 1100.747, "end": 1103.627, "text": "heavy lid on the little Indian girl story."}, {"start": 1103.627, "end": 1104.627, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 1104.627, "end": 1105.627, "text": "Tight heavy lid."}, {"start": 1105.627, "end": 1106.627, "text": "Cool."}, {"start": 1106.627, "end": 1107.627, "text": "THL."}, {"start": 1107.627, "end": 1110.067, "text": "Still friends?"}, {"start": 1110.067, "end": 1115.6232629757785, "text": "Because nobody paid for dinner"}, {"start": 1115.6232629757785, "end": 1119.5126470588236, "text": "at the restaurant and"}, {"start": 1119.5126470588236, "end": 1125.507, "text": "I do not have this kind of money."}, {"start": 1125.507, "end": 1127.507, "text": "I went back to pay the bill."}, {"start": 1127.507, "end": 1130.667, "text": "The restaurant was closed."}, {"start": 1130.667, "end": 1132.667, "text": "Surprise!"}, {"start": 1132.667, "end": 1135.5736666666667, "text": "It was"}, {"start": 1135.5736666666667, "end": 1141.3870000000002, "text": "Abed's idea."}, {"start": 1141.3870000000002, "end": 1146.9070000000002, "text": "The group had stayed behind to salvage the party."}, {"start": 1146.9070000000002, "end": 1153.631761904762, "text": "The waiter had felt bad for spilling the beans"}, {"start": 1153.631761904762, "end": 1159.187, "text": "about Abed's homage so he let us stay."}, {"start": 1159.187, "end": 1164.0762307692307, "text": "As parties go, he was quiet,"}, {"start": 1164.0762307692307, "end": 1168.267, "text": "dark, and a little lame."}, {"start": 1168.267, "end": 1175.0494, "text": "We'd had better parties and"}, {"start": 1175.0494, "end": 1180.827, "text": "we'd had worse parties."}, {"start": 1183.542, "end": 1188.0948358208955, "text": "But I doubt I'll ever forget my"}, {"start": 1188.0948358208955, "end": 1193.382, "text": "dinner with Andre, dinner with Abed."}, {"start": 1193.382, "end": 1197.7820000000002, "text": "Abed, please, allow me."}, {"start": 1201.974, "end": 1202.974, "text": "Okay, thanks."}, {"start": 1202.974, "end": 1203.974, "text": "Let me see."}, {"start": 1208.17, "end": 1209.17, "text": "That's not good."}, {"start": 1209.17, "end": 1210.17, "text": "They said market price."}, {"start": 1210.17, "end": 1211.17, "text": "What market are you shopping at?"}, {"start": 1211.17, "end": 1214.0809375, "text": "I'm"}, {"start": 1214.0809375, "end": 1218.9325, "text": "going"}, {"start": 1218.9325, "end": 1224.9699999999998, "text": "to run."}, {"start": 1224.9699999999998, "end": 1226.4499999999998, "text": "Me too."}, {"start": 1226.4499999999998, "end": 1227.4499999999998, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 1227.4499999999998, "end": 1228.4499999999998, "text": "Three."}, {"start": 1228.4499999999998, "end": 1229.4499999999998, "text": "One."}, {"start": 1229.4499999999998, "end": 1230.4499999999998, "text": "Two."}, {"start": 1230.4499999999998, "end": 1231.4499999999998, "text": "Three."}, {"start": 1231.4499999999998, "end": 1232.4499999999998, "text": "One."}, {"start": 1232.4499999999998, "end": 1233.4499999999998, "text": "Two."}, {"start": 1233.4499999999998, "end": 1234.4499999999998, "text": "Three."}, {"start": 1234.4499999999998, "end": 1235.4499999999998, "text": "Three."}, {"start": 1235.4499999999998, "end": 1236.4499999999998, "text": "Three."}, {"start": 1236.4499999999998, "end": 1236.96, "text": "Four."}]}